                                                                       "Guests"
                                                                   ],
                                                          "operationId":  "getGuest",
                                                          "summary":  "Unified guest profile",
                                                          "description":  "Returns identifiers, the number of visited tenants (`tenantCount`), segments, and feed aggregates. If the guest was absorbed by a merge, the 200 response contains `mergedIntoId` and the UI redirects to the current profile.",
